## WHAT RULE ZERO MEANS

**Methodology is not something you READ and then DO work.**
**Methodology is the WAY you do ALL work.**

```
WRONG MENTAL MODEL:
┌──────────────┐     ┌──────────────┐     ┌──────────────┐
│ Read rules   │ ──► │ Start work   │ ──► │ Forget rules │
└──────────────┘     └──────────────┘     └──────────────┘

CORRECT MENTAL MODEL:
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│              METHODOLOGY (Always Active)                 │
│  ┌──────────┐  ┌──────────┐  ┌──────────┐  ┌──────────┐ │
│  │ Action 1 │  │ Action 2 │  │ Action 3 │  │ Action N │ │
│  └──────────┘  └──────────┘  └──────────┘  └──────────┘ │
│  Every action passes through the methodology filter      │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

